{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billiard of Chaos is a roguelike pool game that requires absolutely no ball-striking skills. You take direct control of the Cue Ball, moving it to earn Score and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/e2a87a0cb59c89b2becdb1d5045e5960.avif?t=1771300865\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase a wide variety of Cues from the in-run store. These cues equip your cue ball with powerful weapons\u2014let it unleash machine-gun barrages, throw high-explosive bombs, or call down purifying beams! You can equip multiple cues per run. Get creative and enjoy the thrill of clearing Red Balls in spectacular fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/7c14780633ee773a8028ebc16c6e5bac.poster.avif?t=1771300865\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/7c14780633ee773a8028ebc16c6e5bac.webm?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/7c14780633ee773a8028ebc16c6e5bac.mp4?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/83be97fdedba7275667b956f1d947044.avif?t=1771300865\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colliding with a red ball damages it. Shatter it to earn score. Your cue ball has no health bar, so forget about survival\u2014just stay on the offensive. Reach the required Score before time runs out to clear the wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/b4bc6d58d0996e1d24e1fbe1c37bb971.poster.avif?t=1771300865\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/b4bc6d58d0996e1d24e1fbe1c37bb971.webm?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/b4bc6d58d0996e1d24e1fbe1c37bb971.mp4?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/df8d1a38bab7097b175d6b147c7f00da.avif?t=1771300865\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the base score from shattering red balls, you have a Mult. Your final score is the product of your base score and this Mult. The store offers various items that increase your Mult in different ways. Once their conditions are met, they dramatically amplify your base score, helping you overcome ever-growing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the score progress bar fills, several Colored Balls will drop. Simply move close and press the &quot;Strike&quot; button to pocket them automatically\u2014no aiming needed. Colored balls in the pocket grant Mult, and arranging them in specific &quot;Pocket Hands&quot; awards bonus Mult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/bb9f2ff57e348e5d567fbb9866fbf0a9.poster.avif?t=1771300865\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/bb9f2ff57e348e5d567fbb9866fbf0a9.webm?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/bb9f2ff57e348e5d567fbb9866fbf0a9.mp4?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/9530ce30a5639edd6f7731bdedd8b807.avif?t=1771300865\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some powerful Equipment requires a specific Sequence of colored balls to activate its attributes. Once active, your cues can transform into superweapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/fba7ecb1479f46780534b34435452046.poster.avif?t=1771300865\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/fba7ecb1479f46780534b34435452046.webm?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/fba7ecb1479f46780534b34435452046.mp4?t=1771300865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/f029645ed7e58b28cf5793816630d6f7.avif?t=1771300865\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 150 unique cues and pieces of equipment, combining them to form countless combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the standard white cue ball, discover a range of unexpected and unique cue balls to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your backpack is stocked with powerful cues and equipment, and your pockets hold the perfect Pocket Hand, sit back and immerse yourself in a spectacular audio-visual fireworks show.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1890630?t=1771300865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/cb3b8cdc32a4d70efce15cf3e142c0694dae35b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771300865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/2ef4567a073f648c21466737cf6673a630d99ce7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771300865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/2ef4567a073f648c21466737cf6673a630d99ce7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771300865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4063070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billiard of Chaos is a roguelike pool game that requires absolutely no ball-striking skills. You take direct control of the Cue Ball, moving it to earn Score and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890630/extras/e2a87a0cb59c89b2becdb1d5045e5960.avif?t=1771300865\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase a wide variety of Cues from the in-run store. These cues equip your cue ball with powerful weapons\u2014let it unleash machine-gun barrages, throw high-explosive bombs, or call down 